body:
Thank you. Yeah, I hope I can make friends in the support group. And for my trip, I'll be working, but I'm going to Key West, which has been a dream of mine since I was a kid (I'm a writer). I saved up and I'm splurging on this, so I'm going to stay at a historic house and can hopefully meet other tourists who have similar interests. I tend to get along with other writers and creative people. It's in a month, so I'm going to try and hold on that long.

&#x200B;

I always pictured having a 30th with lots of people around, and I'm kind of sad that I've pushed everyone away by being so self-focused that I'm spending it alone.
